{"root":"kurang","ipa":"/ku.raŋ/","core":"表示数量、程度或质量不足、缺少、不够，或用于比较级表示“较少”。","pos":["形容词","虚词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ku.raŋ/","zh":"不足；缺少；较少","phrases":[{"t":"kurang baik","zh":"不太好"},{"t":"kurang lebih","zh":"大约；左右"},{"t":"kurang ajar","zh":"没教养的；无礼的"}],"examples":[{"t":"Gula ini kurang manis.","zh":"这糖不够甜。"},{"t":"Dia kurang tidur semalam.","zh":"他昨晚睡眠不足。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kurang","ipa":"/ku.raŋ/","zh":"不足；缺少","phrase":{"t":"kurang dari","zh":"少于"},"example":{"t":"Uang saya kurang sepuluh ribu.","zh":"我的钱少了那一万。"}},{"w":"kekurangan","ipa":"/kə.ku.ra.ŋan/","zh":"缺乏；不足之处；缺点","phrase":{"t":"kekurangan air","zh":"缺水"},"example":{"t":"Dia menyadari kekurangannya.","zh":"他意识到了自己的缺点。"}},{"w":"mengurangi","ipa":"/mə.ŋu.ra.ŋi/","zh":"减少；减去","phrase":{"t":"mengurangi beban","zh":"减轻负担"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus mengurangi penggunaan plastik.","zh":"我们必须减少塑料的使用。"}},{"w":"pengurangan","ipa":"/pə.ŋu.ra.ŋan/","zh":"减少；减法","phrase":{"t":"pengurangan harga","zh":"降价"},"example":{"t":"Ada pengurangan jumlah karyawan.","zh":"员工人数有所减少。"}},{"w":"dikurangi","ipa":"/di.ku.ra.ŋi/","zh":"被减少；被减去","phrase":{"t":"dikurangi pajak","zh":"扣除税款后"},"example":{"t":"Gaji itu dikurangi biaya administrasi.","zh":"工资扣除了管理费。"}}],"derSlugs":["kurang","kekurangan","mengurangi","pengurangan","dikurangi"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:47:42.123Z","src":"base"}